DECLARE
  d jsonb := $p${"chapter":3,"lesson_id":"093eff21-7646-5a6f-aee6-87dd5aaf27d9","slug":"scratch-v3-sensorlar-sikllar","title":"Scratch 3.0: sensorlar, sikllar va kiritish","body":"# Scratch — murakkab sikllar, sensorlar va kiritish\n\n**Maqsad.** Shartga asoslangan takrorlash, ichma-ich sikl, sensor, foydalanuvchi javobi, vaqt va xabarlarni farqlash.\n\n**Manbalar:** ICT 6-sinf (2021), PDF 13, 18–21; Cambridge 8-sinf, PDF 10–39. **Maqomi:** sikllar — spetsifikatsiyaning asosiy tushunchasi; sensor va interfaollik bo‘yicha bu dars — qo‘shimcha.\n\n## Takrorlash bloklari\n\n- `repeat (n)` — tanani **n marta** bajaradi.\n- `forever` — dastur to‘xtatilmaguncha davom etadi.\n- `repeat until <shart>` — shart **yolg‘on** ekan, tana ishlaydi; shart boshidanoq rost bo‘lsa, **0 marta** ishlaydi.\n- `wait until <shart>` — tanani takrorlamaydi; **keyingi buyruqni** shart rost bo‘lishigacha kutadi.\n\n## Ichma-ich sikl\n\n```text\nset [score] to (0)\nrepeat (3)\n  repeat (4)\n    change [score] by (1)\n  end\nend\nsay (score)\n```\n\nNatija **12**: ichki amal `3 × 4` marta bajariladi.\n\n## Sensorlar va vaqt\n\n`touching [mouse-pointer]?`, `touching color [rang]?` va `key [space] pressed?` — **rost/yolg‘on** natijali reporterlar. `ask [savol] and wait` javobni `answer`da saqlaydi. `reset timer` taymerni nollaydi; `timer` vaqt qiymatini beradi.\n\n`broadcast [xabar] and wait` xabar olgan skriptlar yakunini **kutadi**; oddiy `broadcast` kutmaydi.\n\n**Mavzu testi:** `SL3-03-001`–`SL3-03-010` (10 ta).","construct_id":"bef4eae3-502f-5988-a199-b262b91994ca","construct_code":"S4.EXT.SENSOR","group_code":"S4.EXT","construct_title":"Scratch 3.0: sensorlar, sikllar va kiritish","kind":"extension","items":[{"id":"SL3-03-001","ch":3,"level":"A","stem":"`touching [mouse-pointer]?` bloki qanday turdagi natija qaytaradi?","opts":["Yangi sprayt","Matnli ro‘yxat","Faqat son 10","Rost yoki yolg‘on"],"correct":3,"answer":"Rost yoki yolg‘on","why":"Touching? mantiqiy sensor.","source":"ICT6-2021 PD